00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:54,700
2, Latents: compressed visual factors; 3, Tokens: sequences that models can predict.
2、Latents：压缩视觉因素； 3、Tokens：模型可以预测的序列。

618
00:40:54,700 --> 00:40:57,410
These are not independent checklist items.
这些不是独立的清单项目。

619
